00:16:00.180 --> 00:16:05.790
10.1.2.4, which is
outside of subnet 1.

00:16:05.790 --> 00:16:09.450
10.1.1.0/24 is outside.

00:16:09.450 --> 00:16:13.680
But it is inside of
the subnet mask as

00:16:13.680 --> 00:16:17.480
defined by 255.255.0.0,
which is the same network

00:16:17.480 --> 00:16:19.830
as the internal IP.

00:16:19.830 --> 00:16:23.380
The same is also true
for the listen IP2.

00:16:23.380 --> 00:16:25.610
So I want you
understand this picture.

00:16:25.610 --> 00:16:28.810
So let's how you pick up a
correct listen IP and a cluster

00:16:28.810 --> 00:16:31.060
IP to configure your
always on cluster.

