restart of the server.

00:30:21.570 --> 00:30:23.590
What I will expect
after we do this restart

00:30:23.590 --> 00:30:26.440
is that cluster SQL2 will
become the one active.

00:30:30.770 --> 00:30:32.550
And if I'm able to
enter the Enter--

00:30:35.830 --> 00:30:45.750
so minimize that while
And in this case,

00:30:45.750 --> 00:30:49.690
you see it took five
seconds to do the switch.

00:30:49.690 --> 00:30:51.590
In this case, you will
not see the error.

00:30:51.590 --> 00:30:53.410
The query is slipping
every one second.

00:30:53.410 --> 00:30:57.305
So it looks like the whole
